<title>USA: Digital authorizes 15 mln shr repurchase.</title>
<headline>Digital authorizes 15 mln shr repurchase.</headline>
<dateline>MAYNARD, Mass. 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Digital Equipment Corp said its board had authorized the repurchase of up to 15 million shares as evidence of its confidence in the company's future.</p>
<p>Chairman Robert Palmer said in a statement that he is convinced that &quot;Digital is in its best position since the mid-1980s to take advantage of current and emerging market opportunities.&quot;  </p>
<p>In the fiscal fourth quarter Digital repurchased four million of its common shares, and in the full year bought back 10 million shares at a cost of more than $350 million.</p>
</text>
